TEXT 1136 560 Left 2 ;This is a ZOH
TEXT -752 72 Left 2 !*\n* Enter Sampling Frequency\n*\n.PARAM Fs=1Meg\n.PARAM Ts={1/Fs}\n*\n* Enter PID parameters\n*\n.PARAM kp=2.643\n.PARAM ki=2.509k\n.PARAM kd=509.6u\n.PARAM fp=21.8k ; pole for the filtered PID\n*\n.PARAM Td={kd/kp}\n.PARAM Ti={kp/ki}\n*\n.PARAM N={2*pi*fp*Td}\n.PARAM Ad={kp*Td/Ts}\n.PARAM a={Ts/(Ts+Td/N)}\n.PARAM Ap={Kp}\n.PARAM Ai={kp*Ts/Ti}\n*\n* Equivalent poles-zeroes computation *\n*\n.PARAM wz1={(1/Td)-(sqrt(((Ti-4*Td)/Ti))+1)/(2*Td)}\n.PARAM wz2={(sqrt(((Ti-4*Td)/Ti))+1)/(2*Td)}\n.PARAM wpo={ki}\n.PARAM wp1={N/Td}\n.PARAM G0={wpo/wz1}\n*\n.PARAM fz1={wz1/(2*pi)}\n.PARAM fz2={wz2/(2*pi)}\n.PARAM fpo={wpo/(2*pi)}\n.PARAM fp1={wp1/(2*pi)}\n*
